<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #007bff;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Verify Your Email</h2>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering with Rovers! Please verify your email address ({{email}}) by clicking the button below:</p>
    
    <a href="{{verificationLink}}" class="button">Verify Email</a>
    
    <p>This link will expire in 24 hours. If you didn't create an account with us, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2024 Rovers. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
